--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 32f9c881c2954ef4c9284a98d2e72a84, type: 3}
  m_Name: Placeholder_Landing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MarsOutpost.Runtime::MarsOutpost.Core.PlaceholderActivityOutcome
  activityId: landing
  headline: Landing site logged
  summary: Your crew compared hazard tags on the fictional training map and recorded a site choice. A careful survey costs a little power but protects the crew and adds data.
  learningNote: Real Mars landing-site selection uses orbiter images and engineering constraints. This map is a simplified game board, not Mars Trek data.
  changes:
  - resourceId: power
    delta: -10
    reason: The descent burn and site survey use power.
  - resourceId: safety
    delta: 5
    reason: A careful site choice protects the crew.
  - resourceId: science
    delta: 5
    reason: The site survey adds data to the science log.
